# Direct dependencies for Second Ear. requirements.txt is compiled from this file.
# Do not hand-edit requirements.txt; change this file and recompile:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt --python-version 3.11
#
# torch is the CPU build on purpose: Whisper runs on the GPU through CTranslate2
# (faster-whisper), and the DistilBERT scorer scores one 256-token window per
# 4-second chunk (~30 ms on CPU). Training happens in Colab. Keeping torch CPU
# avoids a 2.5 GB download and keeps one CUDA stack in the process.
